{"3793800": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Pulse Drive", "steam_appid": 3793800, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "dlc": [4902850], "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Pulse Drive</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tap  to the beat to build  speed!</strong> <strong>PULSE DRIVE</strong> is an arcade racing game  with a rhythm element. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3793800/extras/c2099907eb99183f0e3095a66e4dd54c.poster.avif?t=1787349845\" width=1024 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3793800/extras/c2099907eb99183f0e3095a66e4dd54c.webm?t=1787349845\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3793800/extras/c2099907eb99183f0e3095a66e4dd54c.mp4?t=1787349845\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drive a futuristic hover vehicle, powered by musical beats!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tap to the beat to go faster.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >50 unique tracks across 5 campaigns in ascending difficulty!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drive, jump, fall or glide across hand crafted dreamlike environments!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play for medals, or compete on the leaderboards against friends!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your own tracks and share them with others!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3793800/extras/ffacf6723bcb4dffc0748e094cfa4b2f.poster.avif?t=1787349845\" width=1170 height=410 ><source s